{"type":"message","id":"b8ccc60b","parentId":"bb42928e","timestamp":"2026-05-12T21:40:57.257Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ken is saying \"all your research cron jobs should already be deleted\" - meaning the research cron jobs on MY server (Karen's server) should be deleted since Maxi is now handling research on Server 2.\n\nLooking back at the cron list I pulled earlier, I still have these research jobs active:\n1. research-ai-tools (1:00 PM daily)\n2. research-local-llm (3:00 PM daily)\n3. research-security (5:00 PM daily)\n\nThese are the ones that timed out yesterday. Ken is saying they should be deleted because Maxi is taking over research on Server 2.\n\nI should delete these three research cron jobs now.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_x6edpTT4FVgxRvZo8NB9PPC8","name":"cron","arguments":{"action":"remove","jobId":"1b680a08-6706-409e-b0e3-46e01b9e4038"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_R32WB0Uvwova6QZHkX504uLs","name":"cron","arguments":{"action":"remove","jobId":"41d2b3f0-c4e5-442b-b232-698ef1a59864"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_aImxnOQ5yi8nE1v1vY83stq8","name":"cron","arguments":{"action":"remove","jobId":"b11e22c6-6b2e-4279-add2-3092a2efe4c6"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p5","usage":{"input":26080,"output":263,"cacheRead":3072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29415,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778622044808,"responseId":"msg_QPQ7tDlM7H2WJsxKQMQsHws1"}}
